# Hermes profile distribution ignore.
# https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/user-guide/profile-distributions
# Credentials, user data, and runtime never belong in the public repo.
# Authored content that stays tracked: SOUL.md, config.yaml, skills/, README.md.

